    "capturedAt": "2026-11-04T03:15:27.178Z",
    "summary": "Slide shows balanced Wheatstone bridge. 12 V ideal battery (+ to node A, - to node D=ground, 0 V so V_A=12 V). Left branch R1=2Ω A-B over R2=4Ω B-D; right branch R3=4Ω A-C over R4=8Ω C-D; bridge R5=5Ω B-C. Voltage-divider gives V_B=12*4/(2+4)=8 V and V_C=12*8/(4+8)=8 V. I5=(V_B-V_C)/R5=0. Balanced condition R1/R2=R3/R4=0.5, so B and C equipotential, no current through R5.",
